ai_context: 'Reach related views through the declared joins on this topic instead of re-deriving relationships.

  Use the modeled business fields meets_registration_quality_threshold rather than reconstructing their formulas.

  Domain definitions for this topic:

  - Registration Confidence Level: A classification where ''High Confidence'' registrations have \text{RAR} > 1.5 and \text{Registration Method} containing ''Target'', where RAR is Registration Accuracy Ratio, ''Medium Confidence'' have RAR between 1.0-1.5, and ''Low Confidence'' otherwise, determining appropriate use cases for spatial analysis and interpretive visualization.'
